msgstr "Ondertitels inschakelen"

msgid "Supermodel Settings - Controllers"
msgstr "Supermodel-instellingen - Controllers"

msgid "Sensitivity"
msgstr "Gevoeligheid"

msgid ""
"Choose the rate at which analog control values increase/decrease when "
"controlled by a key, between 1 to 100. Default is 25."
msgstr ""
"Kies het tempo waarmee analoge besturingswaarden toe- of afnemen bij "
