msgstr "Supermodel-instellingen - Core"

msgid "GPU multi threading"
msgstr "GPU-multithreading"

msgid ""
"Set to ON to run GPU in its own thread instead of sharing the CPU thread. "
"Faster but may cause bugs, depending on the game."
msgstr ""
"Zet op AAN om de GPU in zijn eigen thread te laten draaien in plaats van de "
