msgid "PPC Frequency"
msgstr "PPC-frequentie"

msgid "Choose the PowerPC frequency in MHz, between 1 to 1000. Default is 70."
msgstr "Kies de PowerPC-frequentie in MHz, tussen 1 en 1000. Standaard is 70."

msgid "Service button"
msgstr "Serviceknop"

